## 🎓 Certificate

Students who successfully complete the Bootcamp requirements will have the opportunity to receive an **Honorary Certificate**.

---

## 📌 Important

Try to solve each problem **before watching the solution**.

The goal isn't to memorize the code.

The goal is to learn **how to think**.

